  "job_C11.1_20251003_115124": {
    "chunk_text": "htyn benedicat terra dominum. Bledsige muntas & hyllas drihtyn Benedicite montes et colles dominum. Bledsia\u00f0 ealle acennynde eor\u00f0an drihtyn benedicite omnia nascentia terre dominum. Bledsia\u00f0 s\u00e6 & flodas drihtyn Benedicite maria et flumina dominum. Bledsia\u00f0 wyllas drihtyn benedicite fontes dominum. Bledsia\u00f0 hw\u00e6las & ealle \u00fea beo\u00f0 onstyryd on w\u00e6trum drihtyn Benedicite ceti et omnia que Bledsia\u00f0 ealle fuglas hefynys drihtyn benedicite uolucres celi dominum. Bledsia\u00f0 wildeor & ealle wildeor drihtyn Benedicite bestie et uniuersa pecora dominum. Bearn manna drihtyn benedicite filii hominum dominum. Bledsie israhelys drihtyn benedicat israhel dominum. Bledsia\u00f0 bisceopas drihtnys drihtyn benedicite sacerdotes domini dominum. \u00deeowas drihtnys drihtyn benedicite serui domini dominum. Bledsia\u00f0 gast & sawla rihtwisra drihtyn Benedicite spiritus et anime iustorum dominum. Bledsia\u00f0 halige & ea\u00f0mode heortan drihtyn benedicite sancti et humiles corde dominum. Bledsia\u00f0 & misahel drihtyn bledsiyn we f\u00e6dyr & sunu & gast halig drihtyn hergyn & ofyrhebbyn Gebledsod eart on trymynysse hefonas & hergyndlic & wuldor & ofyruppahafyn on worulde Micla\u00f0 sawle mine drihtyn Magnificat anima mea dominum. & gefyh\u00f0 gast min on gode h\u00e6lyndum minum Et exultauit spiritus meus in deo salutari meo.",
